### Registeration Method Testing
POST {{expense_management_app_HostAddress}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "abc123@example.com",
    "password": "SomethingStrong@123"
}

### Login Method Testing
#### A - Correct Credentials
POST {{expense_management_app_HostAddress}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "abc123@example.com",
    "password": "SomethingStrong@123"
}

#### B - Wrong Password
POST {{expense_management_app_HostAddress}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "abc123@example.com",
    "password": "qwerty"
}

#### C - Incorrect Credentials (both email & password)
POST {{expense_management_app_HostAddress}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "def@example.com",
    "password": "qwerty"
}

### Refresh Token Rotation Testing
POST {{expense_management_app_HostAddress}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### Logout Testing
POST  {{expense_management_app_HostAddress}}/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### Authorization Testing
GET {{expense_management_app_HostAddress}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Testing with Categories.cs & Tags.cs
#### A / Categories.cs
#### Create a Category
POST {{expense_management_app_HostAddress}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "work"
}

#### Retrieve all categories created by the current user
GET {{expense_management_app_HostAddress}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json 

#### B / Tags.cs
#### Create a Tag
POST {{expense_management_app_HostAddress}}/tags
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "non-essential"
}

#### Retrieve all tags created by the current user
GET {{expense_management_app_HostAddress}}/tags
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Testing with ExpenseController.cs
#### Create an expense for the current user
POST {{expense_management_app_HostAddress}}/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "merchant": "woolworth",
    "amount": 10.00,
    "currency": "aud",
    "expenseDate": "2026-08-10T00:00:00Z",
    "categoryId":null,
    "notes":null,
    "tagIds":[]
}

#### Retrieve all expenses of this current user
GET {{expense_management_app_HostAddress}}/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

#### Retrieve one expense of this current user based on expenseId
GET {{expense_management_app_HostAddress}}/expenses/10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

#### Delete one expense of this current user based on expenseId
DELETE {{expense_management_app_HostAddress}}/expenses/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

#### Update one expense of this current user based on expenseId
PUT {{expense_management_app_HostAddress}}/expenses/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
{
    "merchant": "Aldi",
    "amount": 20.00,
    "currency": "usd",
    "expenseDate": "2026-08-13T00:00:00Z",
    "categoryId": 1,
    "notes": "testing",
    "tagIds": [1,2]
}